    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "DOMINO SEMPER PECULIARI SUO VILLICO PAPAE. Vereor quidem, pro hujus tarditate libelli, reus vestri existam imperii.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed si solito pietatis arbitrio mearum amaritudinum pondus inspicitis, necessitati protinus indulgetis. Ut valui, tamen implere quae praecepistis intendi.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quoniam non dubitas, beatis- sime pontifex, quod jam me tibi reddidit perpetua sedulitate subjectum unicae charitalis imperium.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed mirum hoc esse non censeo, dum te in omnium pectoribus sic devinctum esse confido.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam eatenus vos remuneratione superba, diversa beneficii largi- tate praerogativa generalis amplificat, ut in vobis esse probetur ingenitum, quidquid ubi radiat prelio- sum.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et dum generosa natalium dignitate decoratur, humilitate plus nobilem totum te tribuit libertati· Quo fit ut charitalis splendor,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn#PL80.DYN.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/dynamius-patricius/pl80_8_dyn",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.DYN.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qui intra vestri pec- toris arcana immensi luminis claritate praeradiat, et jam corporis serenitatem ostendat, et ita sit cordis speculum, gratia quae renitet in vultu.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 588,
    "date_range": [
      575,
      601
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
